      "jcr:created": "Thu May 07 2020 18:38:36 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Outstanding&nbsp;<span class=\"futura-bold\">educational opportunities</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Gain experience and confidence while networking with your peers through this comprehensive program that delivers outstanding educational opportunities to neurointerventional fellows in their final year of residency. The interactive and personalized curriculum provides a dynamic platform for the exchange of knowledge through resources and training sessions led by respected experts.</span><br>\n</p>\n",
