          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\">Our program managers provide multiple benefits</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The right programs for your entire stroke team</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">High-quality information delivered with integrity</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Industry-leading experts as faculty and proctors</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Insights into the future of stroke care</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Step-by-step guidance during the program.</span><br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
